<title>FRANCE: French unemployment data advanced to Sept 27.</title>
<headline>French unemployment data advanced to Sept 27.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of French unemployment data for August has been advanced to Friday September 27 at the request of the labour ministry, the ministry said.</p>
<p>The figures were originally scheduled for release on September 30.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
